dd95.mp4?t=1730754297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose to isolate yourself and gain individual strength. Face your fear and split up in a high-risk, high-reward strategy. Venturing off alone unlocks powerful solo upgrades and rewards that enhance personal capabilities, making you a formidable force. However, without the protective bonuses of sticking together, you'll need to rely solely on your skills and instincts to survive. This path rewards the bold and daring cloudstrider who seeks glory alone, knowing the risks and potential costs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566730/extras/0e5f367313447f19e5fea111932b35b4.webp?t=1730754297\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566730/extras/4ac7e508f5478adf569a01588a3dd0e4.poster.avif?t=1730754297\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566730/extras/4ac7e508f5478adf569a01588a3dd0e4.webm?t=1730754297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566730/extras/4ac7e508f5478adf569a01588a3dd0e4.mp4?t=1730754297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ancient traditions and cutting-edge technology intertwine in a mystical land where your tribe, the cloudstriders, must rise above all to reclaim its rightful place. Generations ago, the sky was a realm of inspiration and unity, but now it is a battleground infested by relentless mechanical bugs and their regenerating overlord, Baphomet. The cloudstriders must band together, navigating strategic trials and fierce battles on their journey back to the village, where each choice shapes the tribe's fate. United by purpose and tradition, they strive to reclaim their heritage from the darkness and write a new chapter for their people.",
